  "configuration_id": "config_011",
  "reason": "The completed RNA-only experiments show that multiprofile with avgpool is a strong, simple regime, with the best accuracy and F1 from scvi_n200 multiprofile avgpool/transformer, but there is still no evidence that image features are informative under that same regime. config_011 tests an image-only ResNet50 baseline with multiprofile avgpool, matching the profile and aggregation of the best RNA setting. This is the best next experiment because it is simpler than any multimodal fusion configuration, avoids introducing fusion or a second image encoder, and provides a direct baseline for later isolating the effect of adding RNA and fusion."
}

